stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> Ready: Current refresh succeeds
  Loading --> Retry: Read fails or malformed response
  Retry --> Loading: Explicit refresh
  Ready --> Filtered: Select priority, term or status
  Filtered --> Ready: Clear priority, retain other selections
  Filtered --> Filtered: Refresh replaces recorded priority
  Filtered --> Ready: Follow term or comparison link, clear hiding filters
  Ready --> Editing: Change review input
  Filtered --> Editing: Change review input
  Editing --> Editing: Refuse hiding filters and refresh
  Editing --> Saving: Submit valid review
  Saving --> Saving: Refuse hiding filters
  Saving --> Unconfirmed: Receipt unavailable
  Unconfirmed --> Unconfirmed: Refuse hiding filters and refresh
  Unconfirmed --> Saving: Check outcome with identical request
  Saving --> Loading: Receipt confirmed
  Saving --> Editing: Version conflict refresh retains reason
  Loading --> Loading: Ignore stale completion
  Ready --> Retired: Session invalidated or auth refused
  Editing --> Retired: Session invalidated
  Unconfirmed --> Retired: Session invalidated
  Loading --> Disposed: Dispose panel
  Retired --> Retired: Ignore late work
  Disposed --> Disposed: Ignore late work
  %% never hide an unsaved or unconfirmed review
  %% never change canonical data through local filters
  %% never apply a stale response after refresh, retirement or disposal
